{"seq":3,"slug":"adoption-metrics","title":"采纳度量与系统健康","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/operations/adoption-metrics","wordCount":1108,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"采纳度量与系统健康\">采纳度量与系统健康</h1><p>设计系统的成功不由发布频率衡量，而由消费方是否真正使用它来决定。一个拥有 100 个组件但采纳率只有 20% 的系统，其投资回报远不如一个 30 个组件但采纳率 85% 的系统。数据驱动的度量体系让团队能证明系统价值、发现痛点、并指导演进方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设计系统健康度的度量需要覆盖四个维度：采纳广度（多少团队在用）、采纳深度（用了多少组件）、消费体验（用得是否顺畅）、以及系统本身的工程质量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 度量维度&#10;        A[采纳广度 Adoption Breadth]&#10;        B[采纳深度 Adoption Depth]&#10;        C[消费体验 Consumer DX]&#10;        D[系统质量 System Quality]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 数据来源&#10;        A --&gt; R1[npm 下载 / import 分析]&#10;        B --&gt; R2[代码库扫描]&#10;        C --&gt; R3[Issue / 反馈 / 满意度调查]&#10;        D --&gt; R4[CI 指标 / 测试覆盖]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 决策输出&#10;        R1 --&gt; DEC[投资决策]&#10;        R2 --&gt; DEC&#10;        R3 --&gt; DEC&#10;        R4 --&gt; DEC&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 度量维度\n        A[采纳广度 Adoption Breadth]\n        B[采纳深度 Adoption Depth]\n        C[消费体验 Consumer DX]\n        D[系统质量 System Quality]\n    end\n    subgraph 数据来源\n        A --&gt; R1[npm 下载 / import 分析]\n        B --&gt; R2[代码库扫描]\n        C --&gt; R3[Issue / 反馈 / 满意度调查]\n        D --&gt; R4[CI 指标 / 测试覆盖]\n    end\n    subgraph 决策输出\n        R1 --&gt; DEC[投资决策]\n        R2 --&gt; DEC\n        R3 --&gt; DEC\n        R4 --&gt; DEC\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>度量维度</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>告警线</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采纳广度</td>\n<td>使用系统的产品数 / 总产品数</td>\n<td>&gt;80%</td>\n<td>&lt;50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳深度</td>\n<td>产品中系统组件占比</td>\n<td>&gt;70%</td>\n<td>&lt;40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费体验</td>\n<td>组件集成平均时间</td>\n<td>&lt;30min</td>\n<td>&gt;2h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统质量</td>\n<td>无障碍通过率</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>&lt;95%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"采纳率的精确度量\">采纳率的精确度量</h2><p>粗粒度的&quot;下载量&quot;不足以反映真实采纳情况。精确度量需要代码级分析：</p>\n<p><strong>Import 分析</strong>——扫描所有消费方代码库，统计 import 语句：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 度量脚本示例思路&#10;interface AdoptionMetrics {&#10;  // 组件级采纳&#10;  componentUsage: Map&lt;&#10;    string,&#10;    {&#10;      importCount: number;&#10;      uniqueFiles: number;&#10;      teams: string[];&#10;    }&#10;  &gt;;&#10;&#10;  // 覆盖率&#10;  coverage: {&#10;    totalComponents: number;&#10;    usedComponents: number;&#10;    ratio: number;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  // 替代方案检测&#10;  alternatives: {&#10;    component: string;&#10;    alternativePattern: string;&#10;    occurrences: number;&#10;  }[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 度量脚本示例思路</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AdoptionMetrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 组件级采纳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  componentUsage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      importCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      uniqueFiles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      teams</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  >;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 覆盖率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  coverage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    totalComponents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    usedComponents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 替代方案检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alternatives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    component</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    alternativePattern</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    occurrences</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键采纳指标</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组件覆盖率</td>\n<td>被 import 的组件数 / 总组件数</td>\n<td>系统的利用率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渗透率</td>\n<td>使用系统组件的文件 / 总 UI 文件</td>\n<td>替代程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绕过率</td>\n<td>自建替代组件数 / 可用系统组件数</td>\n<td>系统缺口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最新版本采纳</td>\n<td>使用最新 major 的产品数 / 总数</td>\n<td>升级摩擦</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组件级健康仪表盘\">组件级健康仪表盘</h2><p>每个组件应有独立的健康档案：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Button 健康度&#10;        U[使用量: 2340 imports]&#10;        V[版本: 98% 在 latest]&#10;        I[Issue: 2 open / 15 closed]&#10;        T[测试覆盖: 94%]&#10;        A[a11y: PASS]&#10;        B[Bundle: 2.1KB]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Button 健康度\n        U[使用量: 2340 imports]\n        V[版本: 98% 在 latest]\n        I[Issue: 2 open / 15 closed]\n        T[测试覆盖: 94%]\n        A[a11y: PASS]\n        B[Bundle: 2.1KB]\n    end</pre><p>健康度评分模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Health Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Usage</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Freshness</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Quality</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Satisfaction</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Health Score} = w_1 \\cdot \\text{Usage} + w_2 \\cdot \\text{Freshness} + w_3 \\cdot \\text{Quality} + w_4 \\cdot \\text{Satisfaction}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Health Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Usage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Freshness</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Quality</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Satisfaction</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中各权重根据组织优先级调整。典型配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>包含指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Usage</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>Import 数、唯一文件数、团队覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Freshness</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>最新版本采纳率、最后更新时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quality</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>测试覆盖率、a11y 通过率、已知 bug 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Satisfaction</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>满意度评分、Issue 响应时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消费体验的度量\">消费体验的度量</h2><p>消费体验是最容易被忽视但影响最大的维度。如果使用设计系统比&quot;自己写&quot;还难，团队就会绕过系统。</p>\n<p><strong>集成时间</strong>——从决定使用一个组件到在页面上正确渲染的时间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>目标时间</th>\n<th>实际表现</th>\n<th>改进方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单（Button）</td>\n<td>&lt;5 分钟</td>\n<td>✓ 3 分钟</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等（Form）</td>\n<td>&lt;30 分钟</td>\n<td>⚠ 45 分钟</td>\n<td>改进文档示例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂（DataTable）</td>\n<td>&lt;2 小时</td>\n<td>✗ 4 小时</td>\n<td>提供 Recipe</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>摩擦点识别</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Issue 中的 <code>question</code> 标签数量趋势</li>\n<li>Storybook 最常访问但停留时间最长的页面（文档不清晰的信号）</li>\n<li>内部调查中&quot;最难用&quot;投票排名</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"绕过检测-system-bypass-detection\">绕过检测（System Bypass Detection）</h2><p>当团队绕过设计系统自建组件时，是系统存在缺口的强烈信号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 绕过检测规则示例&#10;const bypassPatterns = [&#10;  {&#10;    systemComponent: &#39;Button&#39;,&#10;    bypassSignal: /className=.*bg-(blue|red|green)-\\d+.*onClick/,&#10;    description: &#39;使用原始 Tailwind 类手写按钮&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    systemComponent: &#39;Dialog&#39;,&#10;    bypassSignal: /role=&quot;dialog&quot;(?!.*from [&#39;&quot;]@acme\\/ui)/,&#10;    description: &#39;未使用系统 Dialog 的自建对话框&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    systemComponent: &#39;Toast&#39;,&#10;    bypassSignal: /react-hot-toast|react-toastify/,&#10;    description: &#39;使用第三方 toast 库替代系统组件&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 绕过检测规则示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bypassPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    systemComponent: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Button'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bypassSignal:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">className=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">bg-(blue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">red</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">green)-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">onClick</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'使用原始 Tailwind 类手写按钮'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    systemComponent: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Dialog'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bypassSignal:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">role=\"dialog\"(?!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">from </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">['\"]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">@acme</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">ui)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'未使用系统 Dialog 的自建对话框'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    systemComponent: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Toast'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bypassSignal:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">react-hot-toast</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">react-toastify</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'使用第三方 toast 库替代系统组件'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>绕过发生时的处理流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>理解原因</strong>：是系统缺少能力？API 不好用？还是不知道有这个组件？</li>\n<li><strong>分类处理</strong>：缺失 → 加入路线图；难用 → 改进 DX；不知道 → 改进宣传</li>\n<li><strong>不强制</strong>：绕过往往有合理原因，强制使用不如解决根本问题</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"roi-报告与价值叙事\">ROI 报告与价值叙事</h2><p>向管理层证明设计系统的持续价值需要量化的 ROI 报告：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收益类别</th>\n<th>度量方式</th>\n<th>示例数据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发效率</td>\n<td>新页面平均开发时间对比</td>\n<td>使用系统: 2.5 天 vs 不用: 5 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>品牌审计通过率</td>\n<td>系统组件: 98% vs 自建: 67%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>无障碍合规率</td>\n<td>系统组件: 100% vs 自建: 45%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>UI bug 修复时间</td>\n<td>系统内修一次: 全局生效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>年化节省</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>节省天数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>日均人力成本</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>消费团队数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{年化节省} = \\text{节省天数} \\times \\text{日均人力成本} \\times \\text{消费团队数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年化节省</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节省天数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日均人力成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">消费团队数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采纳率是设计系统最核心的成功指标——没人用的系统没有价值</li>\n<li>度量覆盖四个维度：广度、深度、消费体验、系统质量</li>\n<li>组件级健康仪表盘让每个组件的状态一目了然</li>\n<li>绕过检测是发现系统缺口的最直接信号</li>\n<li>ROI 报告需要量化的数据来持续证明投资价值</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"contribution-governance\">多团队贡献治理</a> — 采纳度量如何指导治理决策</li>\n<li><a href=\"versioning-release\">版本策略与发布流程</a> — 版本采纳率的度量</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-design-tokens-systems/practice/tokens-in-components\">Token 在组件中的应用</a> — Token 采纳的度量方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采纳度量与系统健康","id":"采纳度量与系统健康"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"采纳率的精确度量","id":"采纳率的精确度量"},{"level":2,"text":"组件级健康仪表盘","id":"组件级健康仪表盘"},{"level":2,"text":"消费体验的度量","id":"消费体验的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"绕过检测（System Bypass Detection）","id":"绕过检测-system-bypass-detection"},{"level":2,"text":"ROI 报告与价值叙事","id":"roi-报告与价值叙事"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"多团队贡献治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/operations/contribution-governance"},"next":null}